 "text": "Recorder of Deeds - Cedar County Missouri\nHome\nCounty Commission\nLaw Enforcement\nNews and Announcements\nCounty Offices\nAssessor\nCollector\nCircuit Clerk Court Costs Schedule\nCoroner\nCounty Clerk Election and Voter Registration Information\nElection Results\nFinancial Statements\nHealth Department Announcements\nJuvenile Office\nProsecuting Attorney\nPublic Administrator\nRecorder of Deeds Duties of the Recorder\nAlerts and Announcements\nRecording Requirements\nMarriage license\nMilitary Records\nRecording and Fees\nElectronic Recording\nSheriff Jail Visitation Rules\nConcealed Carry\nCivil Process Fees\nUsing 9-1-1\nSurveyor\nTreasurer\nUniversity Extension\n|\nDuties of the Recorder\nFormatting Requirements\nMarriage license\nMilitary Records\nPlats & Surveys\nRecording Fees\nRecording Time Policy\nElectronic Recording\n|\nLogin Userid: Guest\nPassword: (leave blank)\nCedar County Recorder of Deeds\nMelissa Heskett\nA County-wide elected office with a four year term, the Recorder's position is held by Melissa Heskett. Mrs Heskett was appointed in 2020.\nContact\nCedar County Recorder\nMelissa Heskett\n113 South Street\nStockton, MO 65785\nTel. 417.276.6700 Ext. 246 & 247\nFax. 417.276.5499\nE-mail: recorder@cedarcountymo.gov\nLocated on Courthouse 3rd Floor, Elevator Access Only\nStaff\nRebecca Minix , Deputy Recorder\nOffice Hours\n8:00am to 4:00pm\nMonday - Friday\n(Closed most State and Federal Holidays)\nNeed to pay a fine of check a court date?\nContact the\nCedar County Circuit Clerk\nNeed a tax statement or pay taxes?\nContact the\nCedar County Collector\nRecorder Forms\nProvided for your convenience, please follow these links to forms that will assist you. Thank you\nComplete List of UCC Forms\nMilitary DD-214 Request\nSample Cover Sheet\nLinks\nInternation Association of Clerks, Recorders, Election Officials, and Treasurers\nRecorder's Association of Missouri\nMissouri Association of Counties\nMissouri State Website\nCopyright © Cedar County Missouri | All Rights Reserved.\nDesigned by Click Computers Inc. .\nImages by Flickr/ashraful kadir",
